# A Map of Machine Learning

* Four Branches of Machine Learning

- @Motivation@: A map orients you before the details, showing where a new method
  fits, which tool suits a given problem, and what this course will and will not
  cover

::: columns
:::: {.column width=30%}

- Machine Learning is a field with @many branches@
  `#cite("burkov2019hundredpage")`{=typst}
  - @Paradigms@: How to set up learning `#cite("russell2020aima")`{=typst}
  - @Models@: Functional forms `#cite("hastie2009elements")`{=typst}
  - @Techniques@: Algorithms and processes
  - @Theory@: Formal foundations

::::
:::: {.column width=70%}

